ss (Local)\n- Time of Day\n- Ambient Darkness\n- Player Trail\n- Character Glow\n- Apply Body Color (RGB)\n- Name Spoof (Local)\n- Camera Shake\n- First Person Lock\n- Spin Camera\n- Minimap Radar\n- Player List Overlay\n- Play Animation (Local)\n- Unlimited Zoom\n- Camera Noclip\n- FPS Watermark\n- Custom Crosshair\n\n🎯 ESP\n------\n- Enable Master ESP\n- Show Boxes\n- See Through Walls\n- Show Skeleton\n- Show Health Bar & Text\n- Show Names\n- Show Distance\n- Show Equipped Tool\n- Team Check\n- Enable Highlights\n- Item / Tool ESP\n\n⚔️ PVP / COMBAT\n----------------\n- Auto Heal\n- God Mode (Health Lock)\n- Kill All NPCs\n- Fling / Silent Fling\n- Fling Selected / All Players\n- Fling V2 (R6 & R15)\n- Kill Aura\n- Loop Kill / Loop Kill V2\n- Auto Clicker\n- Reach Extender\n- Enable Hitbox Expander\n- Aimlock\n- Teleport Behind Player\n- Freeze All Players (Client)\n- Select Player (Target)\n\n👥 PLAYER\n----------\n- Copy Outfit (Visual)\n- Reset Outfit\n- Chat Mimic\n- Teleport to Player\n- Bring Player (Client)\n- Spectate Player\n- Follow Player\n- Orbit Player\n- View Profile (Copy URL)\n- Get Player Info\n- Chat Spam\n- Chat Logger\n\n🏷️ TAGS\n--------\n- Global Name Tag\n- Enable My Premium Tag\n- Show Others' Tags\n- Enable Global Chat\n\n📍 POSITION\n-----------\n- Save Current Position\n- Teleport to Position\n- Tween to Position\n- Walk to Position\n- Delete Position\n\n💤 AFK\n------\n- AFK Screen Mode\n- Auto Reconnect\n- Anti-Kick (20m)\n- Spin Bot (Anti-Kick)\n- Auto Jump\n- Auto Walk (AFK)\n- Auto Rejoin on Death\n- Wander Bot (AFK)\n- Anti-AFK (Virtual Input)\n\n🌐 SERVER\n----------\n- Copy Job ID\n- Join by Job ID\n- Rejoin Server\n- Server Hop (Low Pop)\n\n⚡ OPTIMIZE\n-----------\n- Clear Ground Items\n- FPS Cap\n- Disable NPC Animations\n- Disable Shadows\n- Disable VFX (No Particles)\n- Remove Sky & Effects\n- Potato Water & Terrain\n- Force Graphics Level 1\n- Mute All Sounds\n- Remove NPC Accessories\n- Simplify Player Models\n- Remove All De